.TH EUCLID-CLI-ENS-DELETE-TOPIC 1 "August 2026" "euclid-cli 1.0.33" "Euclid CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
euclid-cli-ens-delete-topic \- delete a notification topic
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B euclid-cli ens delete-topic
.BR \-\-topic | \-t
.I ERN
.SH DESCRIPTION
Deletes a topic identified by its Euclid resource name (ERN). This
cannot be undone.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-topic " " \fIERN\fR
Euclid resource name of the topic to delete. Required.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The topic was deleted. No output is printed.
.TP
.B 1
Missing/invalid arguments, the server could not be reached, or no topic
with that ERN exists.
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.nf
euclid-cli --endpoint http://localhost:5566 ens delete-topic \e
    --topic ern:ens:eu-central-1:000000000000:topic:order-events
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR euclid-cli-ens (1),
.BR euclid-cli-ens-create-topic (1),
.BR euclid-cli-ens-get-topic-ern (1),
.BR euclid-cli-ens-list-topics (1),
.BR euclid-cli-ens-purge-topic (1),
.BR euclid-cli-ens-delete-topic-tag (1)
